	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 10th level, when you would fail a saving throw made to resist the charmed, confused, or frightened conditions, you may choose to succeed instead. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a long rest.</p><p>Additionally, you have advantage on saving throws made to resist spells from the enchantment, illusion, and transmutation schools.</p>",
